msgid "- Check share permissions (read/write)\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Egiaztatu partekatzeko baimenak (irakurtzeko/idazteko)\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Ensure NAS is powered on and accessible\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Ziurtatu NAS piztuta dagoela eta eskuragarri dagoela\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Enter server IP, share name, username and password\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Sartu zerbitzariaren IP, partekatu izena, erabiltzaile-izena eta pasahitza\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Go to Main Menu > Setup > System > Storage Manager\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Joan Menu Nagusia > Konfigurazioa > Sistema > Biltegiratze kudeatzailea\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- HDD backups: Stored in /media/hdd/backup\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Diskoko babeskopiak: /media/hdd/backup-en gordeta\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Keep regular backups of your system\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Gorde zure sistemaren ohiko babeskopiak\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- NET backups: Require mounted CIFS/NFS share with write permissions\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- NET babeskopiak: muntatutako CIFS/NFS partekatzea eskatzen dute idazketa-baimenekin\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Never interrupt backup/restore processes\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Ez eten inoiz babeskopia/berreskuratze prozesuak\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Restore: Works from HDD, USB, NET or MMC storage\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Berreskuratu: HDD, USB, NET edo MMC biltegiratzetik funtzionatzen du\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Select 'Network Storage' and add your NAS/SMB share\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Hautatu 'Sare biltegiratzea' eta gehitu zure NAS/SMB partekatzea\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Test connection with ping command\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Probatu konexioa ping komandoarekin\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- USB backups: Require FAT32-formatted drive with 'backupstick' file\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- USB babeskopiak: FAT32 formatuko diskoa behar da 'backupstick' fitxategiarekin\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Use quality USB drives for recovery sticks\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Erabili kalitatezko USB diskoak berreskuratzeko sticketarako\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Verify username/password are correct\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Egiaztatu erabiltzaile-izena/pasahitza zuzenak direla\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Verify you have enough free storage space\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Egiaztatu doako biltegiratze leku nahikoa duzula\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "1. Mount your network share first:\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "1. Muntatu zure sare partekatzea lehenik:\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "2. Select 'NET Backup' from the device list\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "2. Hautatu 'NET Backup' gailuen zerrendan\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "3. Choose your mounted network share\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "3. Aukeratu muntatutako sare partekatzea\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "A recording is currently running. Please stop the recording before trying to start a flashing."
msgstr "Une honetan grabaketa bat martxan dago. Mesedez, gelditu grabazioa keinuka hasten saiatu aurretik."

